1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:01:53,879
Please contact turkision@gmail.com
for any inquiries

2
00:02:04,256 --> 00:02:07,066
NO ANIMALS WERE HARMED DURING THE FILMING
OF THIS PRODUCTION

3
00:02:09,622 --> 00:02:11,963
You will drown in the revenge of
Turks, Subutay.

4
00:05:37,512 --> 00:05:39,512
Run to the tempting arms of death, Osman!

5
00:05:39,642 --> 00:05:40,432
Die!

6
00:07:22,455 --> 00:07:25,475
I am not going to leave this wicked Tent
before I skin you off.

7
00:07:28,428 --> 00:07:32,188
So you decided to haunt our Tent, huh?

8
00:07:48,014 --> 00:07:49,354
Our Tent...

9
00:07:50,742 --> 00:07:54,742
...is going to become your graveyard.

10
00:08:15,636 --> 00:08:16,576
Subutay.

11
00:09:05,704 --> 00:09:08,644
Sofia.

12
00:09:13,918 --> 00:09:16,958
You took two of my children away from me.

13
00:09:26,774 --> 00:09:29,224
Now, it is time to pay for what you did.

14
00:10:54,048 --> 00:10:54,858
Bamsı Bey!

15
00:10:54,858 --> 00:10:56,248
Calm down, Bamsı Bey.

16
00:10:56,248 --> 00:10:58,248
Gündüz Bey will take care of her.

17
00:11:02,405 --> 00:11:03,625
Bamsı Bey!

18
00:11:07,737 --> 00:11:09,377
Take this serpent away!

19
00:11:09,807 --> 00:11:12,447
Keep her wait in the cage till Gündüz Bey
beheads her.

20
00:11:12,447 --> 00:11:13,187
Go now!

21
00:11:47,133 --> 00:11:48,623
Keep an eye on this dog.

22
00:11:54,059 --> 00:11:54,849
Brother.

23
00:11:56,634 --> 00:11:57,594
Let's leave.

24
00:13:03,396 --> 00:13:05,366
Bamsı Bey!

25
00:13:16,931 --> 00:13:19,061
Sofia!

26
00:13:46,755 --> 00:13:47,775
Göktuğ.

27
00:13:52,204 --> 00:13:53,804
Spare me some water.

28
00:13:57,123 --> 00:14:01,363
Instead of dying off your shame, you are
asking for water without any honor.

29
00:14:08,634 --> 00:14:09,684
Water…

30
00:14:10,407 --> 00:14:11,947
…I asked you to give me water.

31
00:14:12,253 --> 00:14:15,223
Do you want me to die of thirst?

32
00:14:18,480 --> 00:14:19,750
Göktuğ.

33
00:14:20,983 --> 00:14:21,933
My...

34
00:14:22,863 --> 00:14:24,493
...my Valiant brother.

35
00:14:25,844 --> 00:14:26,834
Göktuğ.

36
00:15:07,537 --> 00:15:09,997
Kongar has never left anything half done.

37
00:15:38,511 --> 00:15:40,301
Your time has come.

38
00:15:53,374 --> 00:15:55,334
Alps!

39
00:15:58,830 --> 00:16:00,240
Abdurrahman Ghazi!

40
00:16:00,955 --> 00:16:02,795
Alps!

41
00:16:07,554 --> 00:16:08,984
Abdurrahman Ghazi!

42
00:16:12,384 --> 00:16:14,484
Are you okay?

43
00:16:15,340 --> 00:16:16,380
Don't mind me.

44
00:16:16,543 --> 00:16:17,723
Sofia has just ran away.

45
00:16:18,850 --> 00:16:20,660
Go and find her!

46
00:16:20,660 --> 00:16:21,680
Come on!

47
00:16:23,433 --> 00:16:24,693
Faster!

48
00:16:26,186 --> 00:16:27,306
My Valiants.

49
00:16:27,306 --> 00:16:28,696
His condition is very bad.

50
00:16:31,998 --> 00:16:33,198
Osman…

51
00:16:34,223 --> 00:16:38,913
…not a single one but may thousands of
vassals die for your path.

52
00:16:40,422 --> 00:16:42,312
Oh, Abdurrahman Ghazi.

53
00:16:51,414 --> 00:16:52,374
Brother.

54
00:16:52,374 --> 00:16:55,384
-Is the physician from Söğüt here?
-Yes, he is here. My brother.

55
00:16:56,884 --> 00:17:00,264
Let's take him to the dispensary as soon
as possible.

56
00:17:00,475 --> 00:17:01,425
Come on Alps!

57
00:17:01,944 --> 00:17:04,054
Stay strong, Abdurrahman Ghazi.

58
00:17:10,698 --> 00:17:11,657
Come on!

59
00:17:21,512 --> 00:17:22,222
Halt!

60
00:17:23,555 --> 00:17:25,125
We have lost everything, Balgay.

61
00:17:25,555 --> 00:17:27,125
There is no time to talk, woman!

62
00:17:27,125 --> 00:17:28,244
They will be here soon.

63
00:17:38,688 --> 00:17:39,948
They ran away.

64
00:17:40,218 --> 00:17:41,898
What are we going to tell our Bey?

65
00:17:42,747 --> 00:17:43,727
Let’s follow them.

66
00:17:43,727 --> 00:17:44,677
To the horses!

67
00:17:45,020 --> 00:17:47,090
Don’t give up, Abdurrahman Ghazi.

68
00:17:54,489 --> 00:17:55,979
Abdurrahman Ghazi!

69
00:17:57,438 --> 00:17:58,788
Take a look at him.

70
00:18:15,330 --> 00:18:16,880
Abdurrahman Ghazi.

71
00:18:18,853 --> 00:18:20,193
Stay strong.

72
00:18:26,267 --> 00:18:27,147
Stay strong.

73
00:18:30,810 --> 00:18:32,540
He lost a lot of blood, my Bey.

74
00:18:35,140 --> 00:18:37,520
Is Abdurrahman Ghazi going to make it?

75
00:18:37,520 --> 00:18:38,680
Tell me that now!

76
00:18:38,680 --> 00:18:40,300
Only my Rab knows that.

77
00:18:40,447 --> 00:18:44,167
However, for Alps like Abdurrahman,
there is something much worse.

78
00:18:47,767 --> 00:18:50,147
Do whatever it takes to keep him
alive, Physician.

79
00:18:50,539 --> 00:18:51,879
Do whatever it takes!

80
00:19:03,550 --> 00:19:06,010
Then, we need to amputate his arm.

81
00:19:07,690 --> 00:19:11,240
- What are you talking about, physician?
- What are you saying?

82
00:19:12,063 --> 00:19:13,563
What are you talking
about?

83
00:19:21,921 --> 00:19:23,331
That arm...

84
00:19:24,603 --> 00:19:28,323
... serves as the wings
covering our customs.

85
00:19:29,267 --> 00:19:32,937
That arm took many heads.

86
00:19:40,152 --> 00:19:43,282
Do you think to cut that off
is arm is something easy to do?

87
00:19:43,809 --> 00:19:45,719
Do you really think that?

88
00:19:46,117 --> 00:19:49,897
My Bey, I know it’s not easy.

89
00:19:49,897 --> 00:19:53,067
But if we don’t cut the arm, he will
get necrosis and die, my Bey.

90
00:19:53,897 --> 00:19:55,967
His arm needs to be cut and stigmatized.

91
00:20:05,046 --> 00:20:08,106
He will not make it and eventually die.
We need to cut it!

92
00:20:08,649 --> 00:20:13,709
Physician, do anything you need to make...

93
00:20:14,747 --> 00:20:18,747
... Abdurrahman Ghazi will
leave this place alive.

94
00:20:19,573 --> 00:20:22,313
With or without his arm.

95
00:20:23,059 --> 00:20:26,029
Make Abdurrahman Ghazi
leave this place alive.

96
00:20:26,101 --> 00:20:27,551
Only if Allah allows us.

97
00:20:40,583 --> 00:20:42,483
Abdurrahman Gazi.

98
00:21:30,073 --> 00:21:31,313
Göktuğ.

99
00:21:35,861 --> 00:21:38,331
May the tips of your wings not get broken.

100
00:21:38,331 --> 00:21:42,571
"May the tips of your wings
not get broken."

101
00:21:45,454 --> 00:21:49,364
May Allah never let you in need of
he who is despicable.

102
00:21:49,364 --> 00:21:56,394
"May Allah never let you in need of
he who is despicable."

103
00:22:20,824 --> 00:22:23,294
How is Abdurrahman holding up, son?

104
00:22:32,488 --> 00:22:34,108
Not good, mother.

105
00:22:38,010 --> 00:22:40,290
Physician says he may not make it.

106
00:22:42,398 --> 00:22:44,218
What are you saying, son?

107
00:22:44,841 --> 00:22:47,071
Isn’t there another way to save him?

108
00:22:47,708 --> 00:22:52,408
Even if he lives,
his arm needs to be amputated.

109
00:22:55,891 --> 00:23:00,901
From now on,
Abdurrahman Ghazi is handicapped.

110
00:23:05,673 --> 00:23:06,743
Osman!

111
00:23:07,676 --> 00:23:09,066
Come here!

112
00:23:32,732 --> 00:23:34,192
Göktuğ...

113
00:23:41,727 --> 00:23:44,097
My brother Göktuğ...

114
00:24:54,681 --> 00:25:00,491
May the tips of your wings not get broken.

115
00:25:02,579 --> 00:25:03,849
Göktuğ...

116
00:25:18,724 --> 00:25:20,064
Don't.

117
00:25:22,842 --> 00:25:24,542
Brothers, don't...

118
00:25:26,931 --> 00:25:30,931
- Brother!
- Don't.

119
00:25:31,365 --> 00:25:35,975
Brother! What did I do?
Brother!

120
00:25:36,806 --> 00:25:40,846
Help! I beg you!

121
00:25:41,884 --> 00:25:43,004
Please, don't.

122
00:25:50,944 --> 00:25:53,784
Osman!
Face me, Osman!

123
00:25:54,384 --> 00:25:57,014
Stop talking to your women and come here!

124
00:26:11,330 --> 00:26:13,420
Come here, Osman!

125
00:26:17,696 --> 00:26:18,976
Come.

126
00:26:45,424 --> 00:26:49,424
How dare you tie me up, Osman!

127
00:26:52,277 --> 00:26:53,727
Untie my hands!

128
00:26:54,425 --> 00:26:59,445
So that I can show you
the power of Mongols!

129
00:27:30,241 --> 00:27:32,421
Well done, Osman.

130
00:27:33,400 --> 00:27:34,730
Well done.

131
00:27:37,980 --> 00:27:39,250
Well done.

132
00:27:40,447 --> 00:27:42,267
Well done, Osman.

133
00:27:45,645 --> 00:27:48,505
You're brave.

134
00:27:50,706 --> 00:27:52,226
Come here.

135
00:27:54,571 --> 00:27:59,221
Let's see how you fight.

136
00:28:17,865 --> 00:28:19,415
Where is Geyhatu?

137
00:28:22,496 --> 00:28:26,406
Why does he send dogs like you
instead of coming here himself?

138
00:28:26,805 --> 00:28:28,165
Tell me!

139
00:28:28,620 --> 00:28:32,230
Geyhatu will come.
Don't worry.

140
00:28:32,963 --> 00:28:36,963
He's coming back for Baydu.
He'll come for you.

141
00:28:42,220 --> 00:28:43,950
Baydu!

142
00:28:45,193 --> 00:28:49,193
If you're a man,
show me what you can do first.

143
00:29:02,160 --> 00:29:06,720
The Turk is angry!
The dog is angry!

144
00:29:10,072 --> 00:29:11,872
But he'll see!

145
00:29:13,941 --> 00:29:19,341
All of you! All of you will see
the power of the Mongols!

146
00:29:19,726 --> 00:29:21,436
Before we see it...

147
00:29:23,094 --> 00:29:25,294
... you should first...

148
00:29:25,762 --> 00:29:28,122
... taste Osman's slap!

149
00:29:43,257 --> 00:29:45,437
Is this the power of the Mongols?

150
00:29:47,456 --> 00:29:50,346
Is this the reign you're showing off?

151
00:29:51,673 --> 00:29:53,053
Tell me!

152
00:30:17,215 --> 00:30:18,355
Where are the others?

153
00:30:18,355 --> 00:30:20,135
Only we're left, Balgay.

154
00:30:20,135 --> 00:30:22,975
We don't have much time.
Let's go to the castle, Balgay.

155
00:30:23,090 --> 00:30:25,270
We shouldn't lose any more time.

156
00:30:26,312 --> 00:30:29,822
- Everything is over.
- Nothing is over until I'm dead, Sofia.

157
00:30:32,566 --> 00:30:36,566
I will not die until I end them.

158
00:30:38,124 --> 00:30:39,874
Let's go to the castle.

159
00:30:53,553 --> 00:30:58,463
I'll show you the fate of these lands.

160
00:31:02,915 --> 00:31:04,855
Those who come to invade...

161
00:31:06,609 --> 00:31:08,709
... will go as they came.

162
00:31:09,567 --> 00:31:14,477
You ran away here
because you were scared of us.

163
00:31:17,129 --> 00:31:21,689
What changed?

164
00:31:23,368 --> 00:31:27,468
We came again.
We found you again.

165
00:31:30,194 --> 00:31:35,234
We'll be the ones who end you.

166
00:31:40,677 --> 00:31:42,397
We came to this lands...

167
00:31:44,678 --> 00:31:47,378
... to spread Allah's religion.

168
00:31:49,253 --> 00:31:51,283
We came for a holy war!

169
00:31:53,387 --> 00:31:59,647
We came to destroy your
reign of oppression!

170
00:32:04,095 --> 00:32:08,095
Do you think it will end
because you killed everyone?

171
00:32:11,436 --> 00:32:13,876
We'll swarm this place.

172
00:32:14,886 --> 00:32:18,886
We'll come for blood,
for revenge!

173
00:32:19,953 --> 00:32:25,463
Let Alişar's death be an example
to the cruel among us.

174
00:32:36,898 --> 00:32:39,058
And also yours...

175
00:32:44,623 --> 00:32:46,563
... to every cruel...

176
00:33:47,910 --> 00:33:55,040
- Long live, Osman Bey!
- Long live, Osman Bey!

177
00:34:06,395 --> 00:34:11,054
- Allahu Akbar!
- Allahu Akbar!

178
00:34:19,283 --> 00:34:24,873
Send this dog's head to Geyhatu.

179
00:34:30,985 --> 00:34:33,324
He shall see what will happen to him.

180
00:34:41,534 --> 00:34:47,005
Stop!
Don't eat the food!

181
00:34:48,299 --> 00:34:51,799
This traitor poisoned the food!

182
00:34:52,376 --> 00:34:53,466
Eat it.

183
00:34:54,239 --> 00:34:55,580
You dog!

184
00:34:55,719 --> 00:34:59,720
I'll kill those who try to harm us!

185
00:35:39,260 --> 00:35:43,530
Come, son. I'll check your
wound at the tent.

186
00:35:43,530 --> 00:35:45,290
Don't worry. I'm okay.

187
00:35:48,769 --> 00:35:53,249
You're worried because Osman
gets one victory after the other.

188
00:35:54,078 --> 00:35:58,908
Don't, mother.
They're trying to take my father's throne.

189
00:35:59,593 --> 00:36:04,273
But I won't let this go. I won't let Osman
be the Bey while my father is still here.

190
00:36:04,348 --> 00:36:05,758
Know that.

191
00:36:06,492 --> 00:36:12,952
It's not about Osman, son.
It's the upcoming disaster.

192
00:36:14,847 --> 00:36:18,077
We'll get rid of Osman.
But...

193
00:36:19,308 --> 00:36:21,608
... Geyhatu will come.

194
00:36:22,620 --> 00:36:25,290
Osman went too far this time.

195
00:36:25,829 --> 00:36:28,489
Subutay was Geyhatu's right hand.

196
00:36:28,948 --> 00:36:31,998
- He took his life.
- He deserved it, mother.

197
00:36:33,675 --> 00:36:41,325
He did. But Geyhatu will be furious
after hearing about this.

198
00:36:41,824 --> 00:36:46,504
Then he'll attack Kayıs with his army.

199
00:36:47,145 --> 00:36:52,185
Our duty is to save Kayıs from this, son.

200
00:36:53,634 --> 00:36:59,404
There is only one person
who will and can do this.

201
00:37:00,546 --> 00:37:03,676
- My uncle.
- That's right.

202
00:37:05,003 --> 00:37:09,833
You'll go to him.
You'll inform him about what happened.

203
00:37:10,694 --> 00:37:13,984
People in the Tent don't need to know
about where you're going.

204
00:37:13,984 --> 00:37:18,954
I'll tell them he went to thank
his brother for the intel.

205
00:37:20,731 --> 00:37:23,741
Tell him everything thoroughly.

206
00:37:23,840 --> 00:37:29,150
So that he can think of a solution
for the upcoming storm.

207
00:38:03,062 --> 00:38:05,302
Osman won't let Subutay live.

208
00:38:07,825 --> 00:38:13,445
Osman will make Geyhatu come here himself.

209
00:38:13,445 --> 00:38:15,535
He won't come, woman! He won't!

210
00:38:16,702 --> 00:38:19,952
After Konya, he went back.

211
00:38:21,955 --> 00:38:26,535
So, Osman could attack your castle
any second now.

212
00:38:27,546 --> 00:38:29,746
We don't hear from Kongar either.

213
00:38:29,746 --> 00:38:32,996
Are you really thinking about Kongar now?

214
00:38:37,743 --> 00:38:40,423
Tell me, how did Osman
find out about the ambush?

215
00:38:41,585 --> 00:38:43,925
Balgay this, Balgay that.
How should I know?

216
00:38:44,372 --> 00:38:47,842
I came to save your life
and you're questioning me.

217
00:39:13,827 --> 00:39:15,247
Who are they?

218
00:39:15,648 --> 00:39:20,168
My executioners who will destroy Osman.

219
00:39:46,251 --> 00:39:50,501
We'll find remedies for our veterans
after we bury our martyrs.

220
00:39:50,532 --> 00:39:52,842
We'll get the Tent on its feet again.

221
00:39:55,083 --> 00:39:58,183
We're responsible for relieving
the Tent's wounds.

222
00:40:01,282 --> 00:40:03,522
These eyes saw many things...

223
00:40:04,914 --> 00:40:06,854
We'll get through this eventually.

224
00:40:07,272 --> 00:40:11,272
We should look for damages and losses.

225
00:40:11,752 --> 00:40:13,682
The rest is easy, with Allah's help.

226
00:40:16,126 --> 00:40:19,186
Aygül! My arm hurts!

227
00:40:19,186 --> 00:40:21,066
Why are you squeezing it?

228
00:40:25,209 --> 00:40:28,099
What? Are you okay?

229
00:40:30,792 --> 00:40:32,112
Hazal Hatun.

230
00:40:39,986 --> 00:40:43,126
We suffered too much from our conflicts.

231
00:40:44,085 --> 00:40:49,655
My opinions about you were biased
because of this. I'm sorry.

232
00:40:49,832 --> 00:40:51,702
I was unfair to you.

233
00:40:51,738 --> 00:40:54,968
Well, you weren't wrong, Selcan.

234
00:40:55,322 --> 00:40:58,042
Your eyes saw such betrayals.

235
00:40:58,629 --> 00:41:02,139
You'll protect your Tent. Of course.

236
00:41:04,168 --> 00:41:10,888
But now you very well know who is who.

237
00:41:14,761 --> 00:41:19,581
As long as we're together,
we'll take care of the rest.

238
00:41:19,581 --> 00:41:20,941
If Allah permits.

239
00:41:27,380 --> 00:41:29,600
Why are you knitting your eyebrows?

240
00:41:30,500 --> 00:41:33,760
There's blood everywhere.
It won't wash off.

241
00:41:34,982 --> 00:41:37,432
These days will pass, Aygül.

242
00:41:38,406 --> 00:41:39,856
Don't be upset.

243
00:41:41,681 --> 00:41:45,141
It will be over.
Don't be upset.

244
00:42:38,815 --> 00:42:40,455
Dündar Bey...

245
00:42:47,190 --> 00:42:48,550
Bamsı Bey...

246
00:42:51,266 --> 00:42:54,406
- Am I okay?
- The Physician is here.

247
00:42:54,663 --> 00:42:57,443
Don't tire yourself, Abdurrahman Ghazi.

248
00:42:57,443 --> 00:43:00,473
He'll do everything necessary.
Don't tire yourself.

249
00:43:07,200 --> 00:43:09,500
How is my arm doing?

250
00:43:26,988 --> 00:43:28,918
We need to cut it.

251
00:43:30,500 --> 00:43:32,570
There is no other way.

252
00:43:33,464 --> 00:43:37,464
Dündar Bey!
Bamsı Bey!

253
00:43:38,917 --> 00:43:45,477
We swing our swords with our hearts,
not arms!

254
00:43:49,725 --> 00:43:51,765
Bless you!

255
00:43:52,766 --> 00:43:57,636
Tevekkeltü Tealallah
[I trust in Allah]

256
00:43:58,955 --> 00:44:02,955
Tevekkeltü Tealallah
[I trust in Allah]

257
00:44:07,781 --> 00:44:09,211
My Osman...

258
00:44:52,229 --> 00:44:55,839
Stay!
Stay, Dündar Bey!

259
00:44:56,542 --> 00:44:58,102
Witness it!

260
00:45:00,437 --> 00:45:02,137
Witness it.

261
00:45:03,498 --> 00:45:07,928
Abdurrahman Gazi, the friend of Kayıs...

262
00:45:09,357 --> 00:45:16,327
... will sacrifice his arm in the name
of Allah without batting an eye!

263
00:45:17,750 --> 00:45:23,170
We're witnesses, Abdurrahman Gazi.
We're witnesses.

264
00:45:24,988 --> 00:45:26,878
We're witnesses.

265
00:45:30,516 --> 00:45:32,306
We're witnesses.

266
00:45:34,546 --> 00:45:38,546
Witness me, dear Allah!

267
00:45:38,689 --> 00:45:43,989
Abdurrahman Ghazi!
We grew up with your tales of war.

268
00:45:57,783 --> 00:45:59,213
Hold on!

269
00:46:00,901 --> 00:46:02,151
Hold on!

270
00:46:04,296 --> 00:46:08,296
Hold on!

271
00:46:09,786 --> 00:46:15,616
How could I let you go easily,
Abdurrahman Ghazi?

272
00:46:16,465 --> 00:46:21,005
My brother...
Hold on.

273
00:46:21,465 --> 00:46:22,547
Hold on.

274
00:46:23,119 --> 00:46:24,429
My brother!

275
00:46:35,188 --> 00:46:36,568
Physician!

276
00:46:38,321 --> 00:46:41,741
Do it!
Cut my arm off!

277
00:46:47,249 --> 00:46:48,299
Do it!

278
00:47:02,432 --> 00:47:06,432
Bismillahirrahmanirrahim.
[in the name of Allah, the merciful and compassionate.]

279
00:47:07,938 --> 00:47:09,578
Dear Allah...

280
00:47:11,598 --> 00:47:12,918
Ya Allah!

281
00:49:33,421 --> 00:49:36,241
You're living in an imaginary
world, Sofia.

282
00:49:37,575 --> 00:49:43,895
Osman killed my Nökers and your knights.

283
00:49:45,952 --> 00:49:48,602
Will these take our revenge?

284
00:51:07,924 --> 00:51:09,764
This is a spell.

285
00:51:15,693 --> 00:51:19,063
They are possessed, Cerkutay.

286
00:51:20,693 --> 00:51:25,723
They sold their souls to the devil.

287
00:51:31,088 --> 00:51:33,068
Not to the devil...

288
00:51:35,407 --> 00:51:37,297
... to my father.

289
00:51:40,784 --> 00:51:46,964
The secret which removed their fear of
death is hidden in the potion they drank.

290
00:51:50,507 --> 00:51:55,507
What if they're not afraid?
Won't they die?

291
00:51:56,861 --> 00:51:58,641
Of course they die.

292
00:52:01,081 --> 00:52:03,331
But they don't feel pain!

293
00:52:12,658 --> 00:52:19,778
Dark knights continue fighting as long
as they don't have fatal wounds.

294
00:52:26,236 --> 00:52:30,236
What kind of a potion is this?
Why didn't you tell me before?

295
00:52:30,965 --> 00:52:35,785
My father completed it on his last days.

296
00:52:38,323 --> 00:52:42,653
He didn't have time to tell me
how he did it.

297
00:52:43,588 --> 00:52:48,758
Pity.
Yannis is no more.

298
00:52:49,513 --> 00:52:53,513
But the potion is here.

299
00:52:56,419 --> 00:52:58,489
I want some of it.

300
00:52:59,314 --> 00:53:01,604
Unfortunately, it's impossible.

301
00:53:02,112 --> 00:53:07,342
We've used the last bottle.
The effects will continue for a few days.

302
00:53:07,898 --> 00:53:11,898
That means we don't have much
time to kill Osman.

303
00:53:16,445 --> 00:53:19,675
What will happen when
the potion wears out?

304
00:53:19,675 --> 00:53:23,675
The effects won't wear out.
They will change.

305
00:53:26,629 --> 00:53:32,609
It will turn into poison and kill them.

306
00:53:45,322 --> 00:53:52,552
Osman, who doesn't fear death,
will fight the dead.

307
00:53:56,491 --> 00:53:58,371
Balgay liked this.

308
00:54:08,727 --> 00:54:09,907
Knights!

309
00:54:39,585 --> 00:54:40,975
Brother!

310
00:54:41,612 --> 00:54:45,612
We should let him rest. He shouldn't
be in the middle of everything.

311
00:54:51,688 --> 00:54:56,008
I'll take one life
for each drop of his blood!

312
00:54:58,722 --> 00:55:01,772
If not for Hazal Hatun, we'd
have many more casualties.

313
00:55:02,299 --> 00:55:06,299
It's obvious. But...

314
00:55:07,280 --> 00:55:10,920
How did Çobanoğulları
know about this ambush?

315
00:55:13,289 --> 00:55:17,549
Son, it seems their
intelligence is strong.

316
00:55:18,523 --> 00:55:20,943
This is suspicious, Bamsı Bey.

317
00:55:21,847 --> 00:55:28,567
My shame is enough for me, nephew.
If you have suspicions, tell me.

318
00:55:28,567 --> 00:55:32,567
Thanks to them, the Tent
was ready for the attack.

319
00:55:33,042 --> 00:55:35,032
I was there at the last minute.

320
00:55:36,266 --> 00:55:41,106
But, if they knew
about the attack earlier...

321
00:55:41,683 --> 00:55:46,393
... it means they are seeing us,
watching us, uncle.

322
00:55:48,863 --> 00:55:52,063
There is more to this.

323
00:56:07,790 --> 00:56:09,520
Sofia has escaped, my Bey!

324
00:56:10,720 --> 00:56:12,890
How did she escape, speak!

325
00:56:13,210 --> 00:56:15,760
Balgay came, my Bey,
they escaped together.

326
00:56:18,704 --> 00:56:21,674
Only place for them to
hide is the castle.

327
00:56:22,174 --> 00:56:29,054
Now is the time to take them out
of the castle and end them!

328
00:56:29,768 --> 00:56:31,398
How will we do this, brother?

329
00:56:31,514 --> 00:56:35,514
As long as they are in that castle,
there's no rest for us.

330
00:56:40,275 --> 00:56:45,135
I've sent my Alps to take Konur
and Dumrul. They haven't returned.

331
00:56:46,362 --> 00:56:49,592
After Göktuğ comes here...

332
00:56:50,157 --> 00:56:51,877
... we'll see what we can do.

333
00:56:53,765 --> 00:56:54,855
Let's go.

334
00:57:23,077 --> 00:57:24,877
What is he doing here?

335
00:57:28,432 --> 00:57:32,042
How could that coward come here!

336
00:57:33,397 --> 00:57:37,397
Stop, my Bey. Göktuğ brought news.

337
00:57:38,157 --> 00:57:42,157
He could've killed both
of us if he wanted to.

338
00:57:56,120 --> 00:58:00,900
How many faces, heads
are there above your shoulders?

339
00:58:01,299 --> 00:58:02,469
Speak!

340
00:58:06,218 --> 00:58:08,208
Balgay put a spell on me.

341
00:58:09,138 --> 00:58:12,338
You, vile coward!

342
00:58:12,338 --> 00:58:17,138
How many times we'll
belive you, how many will die?

343
00:58:22,045 --> 00:58:26,595
Balgay poisoned me, he stole my soul.

344
00:58:29,241 --> 00:58:33,781
He made me hurt my brothers!

345
00:58:35,788 --> 00:58:37,278
Stop, Bamsı Bey.

346
00:58:41,877 --> 00:58:43,317
Bamsı Bey...

347
00:58:45,317 --> 00:58:47,077
Bamsı Bey, don't.

348
00:58:48,199 --> 00:58:54,169
Don't do this, my Bey.

349
00:58:57,455 --> 00:58:59,355
Don't, Bamsı Bey.

350
00:59:19,693 --> 00:59:22,603
Go, take Konur to medical tent.

351
00:59:34,413 --> 00:59:38,283
Osman Bey, let me stay with my brother.

352
00:59:38,655 --> 00:59:42,655
If something happens to him,
bury my body under his feet.

353
00:59:48,027 --> 00:59:52,027
Boran, watch him closely.

354
00:59:52,939 --> 00:59:55,119
If he tries to do something.

355
00:59:58,516 --> 00:59:59,936
Kill him.

356
01:00:04,526 --> 01:00:06,136
As you command, my Bey.

357
01:00:40,115 --> 01:00:43,385
- How are you, son?
- I'm good, father.

358
01:00:44,429 --> 01:00:50,249
My Bahadır is well, thank Allah.
But you, are you okay, my Bey?

359
01:00:50,249 --> 01:00:53,499
I am alive. I am alive.

360
01:00:53,501 --> 01:00:57,501
But I'm not well.

361
01:01:00,172 --> 01:01:05,352
We've overcome a disaster.
Now is the time to recover.

362
01:01:05,777 --> 01:01:09,057
We'll be okay, don't you worry.

363
01:01:10,835 --> 01:01:17,765
Hazal, I have a question,
but I can't find the answer.

364
01:01:17,788 --> 01:01:24,148
Tell me, how did your brother
know about the ambush when...

365
01:01:24,681 --> 01:01:26,421
... we could not?

366
01:01:28,780 --> 01:01:33,990
My brother knows everything going on in
this region, Dündar Bey, don't you know?

367
01:01:33,990 --> 01:01:38,960
They say Yavlak Hasan doesn't sleep,
father. He's always watching.

368
01:01:38,960 --> 01:01:42,960
If he doesn't, his men will, if they
don't, wolves and birds tell him.

369
01:01:45,883 --> 01:01:49,883
Thanks to them for this.

370
01:01:49,923 --> 01:01:54,773
But this is only our issue now.

371
01:01:55,752 --> 01:02:01,302
I agree, my Bey. But since he
gave us the information...

372
01:02:01,892 --> 01:02:05,232
... we need to thank my brother for that.

373
01:02:05,517 --> 01:02:10,097
I say Bahadır goes there.
He can see his uncle...

374
01:02:10,424 --> 01:02:15,764
... and give Kayı Tent's
gratitude and greetings to him.

375
01:02:17,011 --> 01:02:19,581
What do you say, my Bey?

376
01:02:19,993 --> 01:02:24,513
Your mother is right,
son, go to Çobanoğulları.

377
01:02:25,058 --> 01:02:29,478
Tell them that Kayıs stand strong.

378
01:02:30,117 --> 01:02:36,187
But they should know, this is
our issue from now on.

379
01:02:36,440 --> 01:02:38,810
Tell them that.

380
01:02:38,810 --> 01:02:40,420
I will, father.

381
01:02:41,136 --> 01:02:45,136
Let's go, you should take
your Bey's permission.

382
01:02:45,136 --> 01:02:48,046
Let's go and tell Gündüz Bey.

383
01:03:05,622 --> 01:03:09,622
It will pass, don't worry.

384
01:03:24,820 --> 01:03:27,500
You showed mercy, brother.

385
01:03:27,960 --> 01:03:30,080
But how can we trust that Göktuğ?

386
01:03:31,171 --> 01:03:37,981
Son, Gündüz is right. Our
mercy could bring us trouble.

387
01:03:38,913 --> 01:03:41,543
Don't you worry.

388
01:03:41,821 --> 01:03:44,221
He will give us Sofia and Balgay.

389
01:03:55,291 --> 01:04:01,391
Gündüz Bey, if you allow us,
Bahadır will go on a journey.

390
01:04:05,162 --> 01:04:06,302
What is it, uncle?

391
01:04:06,587 --> 01:04:10,587
We should thank
Muzaffereddin Yavlak Hasan.

392
01:04:11,109 --> 01:04:15,429
And they could see each other.
Uncle and nephew.

393
01:04:30,457 --> 01:04:33,507
You thought well, uncle.

394
01:04:34,577 --> 01:04:38,577
Bahadır, give my regards to your uncle.

395
01:04:39,928 --> 01:04:42,988
We will return his kindness, surely.

396
01:04:45,535 --> 01:04:49,535
He knows that we neither forget kinship...

397
01:04:50,718 --> 01:04:52,888
... nor rivalry.

398
01:04:55,102 --> 01:04:58,812
As you say, Osman Bey,
I will give your regards to him.

399
01:04:59,868 --> 01:05:03,228
My Bey, I will go if you'll excuse me.

400
01:05:35,039 --> 01:05:38,379
My wish was to bring
my brother to the Tent.

401
01:05:40,089 --> 01:05:40,999
I brought him.

402
01:05:43,574 --> 01:05:47,574
Now, It's hard for me to live.

403
01:05:49,494 --> 01:05:54,964
Good, you can still feel shame then.

404
01:06:03,319 --> 01:06:07,319
From now on, my blood and life is yours.

405
01:06:08,334 --> 01:06:12,334
If you want, I will bring
Balgay's head to you.

406
01:06:12,551 --> 01:06:15,731
Or you can take my head instead.
Your call.

407
01:06:16,364 --> 01:06:18,384
My life is yours only.

408
01:06:44,838 --> 01:06:48,278
Your brother's head always looked up.

409
01:06:49,078 --> 01:06:50,208
Göktuğ!

410
01:06:51,748 --> 01:06:53,918
Lift your head up.

411
01:06:58,836 --> 01:07:01,396
You won't give your life for us.

412
01:07:03,556 --> 01:07:05,756
You will give it for your brother.

413
01:07:26,949 --> 01:07:30,659
Aygül, come here girl.

414
01:08:05,489 --> 01:08:10,379
This madness of her is
enough already, but...

415
01:08:11,956 --> 01:08:13,786
... we'll see.

416
01:09:14,089 --> 01:09:18,089
May your enemies froze, may your
arrows find their target, my Bey.

417
01:09:18,089 --> 01:09:19,089
Amin.

418
01:09:20,591 --> 01:09:22,270
Amin, Hatun.

419
01:09:27,669 --> 01:09:31,669
Sofia is an old enemy.

420
01:09:32,618 --> 01:09:34,749
They caused our Tent so much trouble.

421
01:09:42,970 --> 01:09:46,970
And you, and my Sheikh...

422
01:09:47,118 --> 01:09:49,319
... you faced death by their hands.

423
01:09:50,729 --> 01:09:53,889
It's time to answer for their crimes.

424
01:09:55,393 --> 01:09:58,913
It's not only Sofia, Balgay is also there.

425
01:09:59,428 --> 01:10:01,218
The fight will be hard, my Bey.

426
01:10:01,218 --> 01:10:06,468
Köni, Subutay, Balgay,
Geyhatu, and then...

427
01:10:07,322 --> 01:10:08,872
... another tyrant.

428
01:10:11,344 --> 01:10:16,194
The fight won't be over
until life ends, Hatun.

429
01:10:23,361 --> 01:10:26,471
Then, may Allah give you long life.

430
01:10:26,726 --> 01:10:31,016
Long may you live, my Osman.
May many victories be yours.

431
01:10:31,395 --> 01:10:35,395
May you live a long life too, so that...

432
01:10:35,395 --> 01:10:38,755
... I can return to your side, Hatun.

433
01:10:51,071 --> 01:10:53,031
May Allah protect you.

434
01:11:02,347 --> 01:11:06,347
You too, my Osman. May Allah guide you.

435
01:11:24,176 --> 01:11:28,176
Even if you do, I won't forgive myself.

436
01:11:31,462 --> 01:11:35,462
If something happens to you,
brother, how could I live with that?

437
01:11:39,694 --> 01:11:43,394
Göktuğ, don't say that.

438
01:11:55,704 --> 01:11:56,534
Göktuğ.

439
01:11:59,355 --> 01:12:03,355
I have neither gold...

440
01:12:03,355 --> 01:12:07,355
... nor wealth or property.

441
01:12:09,435 --> 01:12:14,045
My only heritage to you is
my loyalty to Osman Bey.

442
01:12:14,045 --> 01:12:17,185
Brother. Don't talk like that.

443
01:12:17,945 --> 01:12:21,945
May you become a valiant Alp of Osman Bey.

444
01:12:22,971 --> 01:12:27,381
We'll take revenge with
Osman Bey, brother.

445
01:12:30,149 --> 01:12:32,389
We are going to take
that dog's head for you.

446
01:12:49,942 --> 01:12:50,892
My Bey.

447
01:12:53,706 --> 01:12:56,026
You are going to fight, huh?

448
01:12:56,026 --> 01:12:57,106
My Konur...

449
01:12:58,547 --> 01:13:00,207
Without me!

450
01:13:09,492 --> 01:13:11,484
You recover first.

451
01:13:14,756 --> 01:13:17,030
We have conquests to have.

452
01:13:23,710 --> 01:13:25,958
Don't worry at all.

453
01:13:27,512 --> 01:13:29,996
I will avenge you.

454
01:13:30,547 --> 01:13:32,978
I will rip the hearts of...

455
01:13:33,458 --> 01:13:35,238
...those who hurt you.

456
01:13:40,575 --> 01:13:45,272
You just hold your horses, brother.

457
01:13:48,223 --> 01:13:51,001
Don't you dare...
Don't...

458
01:13:52,075 --> 01:13:54,598
...leave me without my Konur.

459
01:13:57,218 --> 01:14:03,603
Konur, your face glowed when you heard
about conquest and jihad, my valiant.

460
01:14:08,347 --> 01:14:12,574
He is my Konur. He can bear it.
I know he can. With Allah's help.

461
01:14:13,362 --> 01:14:15,424
Bamsı Bey.

462
01:14:16,016 --> 01:14:17,742
May you live long!

463
01:14:25,182 --> 01:14:26,742
Göktuğ.

464
01:14:28,461 --> 01:14:30,600
It's time.

465
01:14:31,813 --> 01:14:33,660
Duty calls.

466
01:14:34,281 --> 01:14:36,460
My life is yours, Osman Bey.

467
01:14:58,961 --> 01:15:01,022
Give me your blessing, brother.

468
01:15:04,041 --> 01:15:10,485
My blessing is yours.
Every bit of it.

469
01:15:43,213 --> 01:15:44,932
Brother.

470
01:15:46,113 --> 01:15:47,936
Brother.

471
01:15:50,393 --> 01:15:52,273
My blessing is yours.

472
01:15:54,277 --> 01:15:56,552
Is yours mine, too?

473
01:15:59,253 --> 01:16:00,894
Tell me.

474
01:16:02,374 --> 01:16:04,753
Of course, my Bey.

475
01:16:07,923 --> 01:16:09,905
And may Allah bless us all.

476
01:16:33,273 --> 01:16:34,795
Bamsı Beyrek.

477
01:16:39,325 --> 01:16:42,004
May you live long.
Thank you, my Bey.

478
01:16:44,015 --> 01:16:45,235
May you live long.

479
01:17:22,062 --> 01:17:25,514
Balgay thinks that I'm on
the road of Konya with Boran.

480
01:17:27,640 --> 01:17:30,019
He will come after us for Genghis'
relic.

481
01:17:31,640 --> 01:17:36,961
Bamsı Bey. Your mission is watching our
back against Sofia.

482
01:17:38,499 --> 01:17:43,606
Our eyes, ears, and hearts are with you...

483
01:17:44,021 --> 01:17:47,439
...with the help of Allah, my Bey.

484
01:17:50,523 --> 01:17:54,853
For our cause, martyrs, gazis...

485
01:17:55,436 --> 01:17:57,912
...and for...

486
01:17:58,383 --> 01:18:00,853
...all the innocents.

487
01:18:02,196 --> 01:18:04,857
May Allah help us.

488
01:18:05,808 --> 01:18:08,573
May Allah accompany us.

489
01:18:18,325 --> 01:18:19,759
My Osman.

490
01:18:24,419 --> 01:18:26,900
Come on, warriors.
Giddyap!

491
01:19:35,386 --> 01:19:37,036
My son!

492
01:19:38,826 --> 01:19:41,843
Are you alright, my son?
What have they done to you?

493
01:19:43,633 --> 01:19:46,732
I killed that dog called Konur.

494
01:19:48,582 --> 01:19:51,696
I hardly escaped from their hands.

495
01:19:52,343 --> 01:19:55,783
Don't worry, my son. I will skin them
alive! Skin them all alive!

496
01:19:57,622 --> 01:20:01,769
Osman will take the Genghis' Laws...

497
01:20:02,263 --> 01:20:04,949
...to Geyhatu.

498
01:20:10,622 --> 01:20:15,421
-Osman!
-He will have only one warrior with him.

499
01:20:16,543 --> 01:20:19,042
Only two of them.

500
01:20:23,000 --> 01:20:25,620
You will get better, Kongar.
You will be healed.

501
01:20:26,878 --> 01:20:29,801
What are you waiting for, woman?
Don't you have a healer?

502
01:20:31,109 --> 01:20:33,378
Hurry, take him to the physician.

503
01:20:33,645 --> 01:20:38,183
Don't worry. Don't worry, Kongar.
You will be healed.

504
01:20:39,397 --> 01:20:42,403
Hurry, hurry, hurry!

505
01:20:43,300 --> 01:20:45,617
Hurry up!

506
01:20:54,478 --> 01:20:58,421
Hurry up! Come on! Hurry!

507
01:21:01,198 --> 01:21:07,638
Those Laws belongs to me, not Geyhatu.
Those relics are my right!

508
01:21:10,618 --> 01:21:14,499
-Bring my horse!
-We'll go together. I'm coming with you.

509
01:21:16,038 --> 01:21:20,263
Were you with me under the frost of
steppes or the heat of deserts, woman?

510
01:21:21,626 --> 01:21:26,798
I will take the revenge of my son
on my own.

511
01:21:29,720 --> 01:21:33,693
Don't push your luck, Sofia.

512
01:21:56,172 --> 01:21:58,912
Bear of the steppe is after his revenge.

513
01:22:02,493 --> 01:22:04,957
I won't leave Osman to him.

514
01:22:06,633 --> 01:22:09,873
Tell the knights to get ready at once.
We are leaving.

515
01:22:17,560 --> 01:22:21,013
I will wash my hands with the blood
of Osman.

516
01:22:36,810 --> 01:22:38,352
We did what we could.

517
01:22:38,981 --> 01:22:40,933
But the wound is infected.

518
01:22:43,977 --> 01:22:46,690
If you have anything to say,
we don't have much time.

519
01:23:09,168 --> 01:23:11,634
Konur...
Brother...

520
01:23:13,217 --> 01:23:17,128
Hang in there.
You can't go like this.

521
01:23:28,095 --> 01:23:29,435
My Bey.

522
01:23:32,489 --> 01:23:33,958
Göktuğ...

523
01:23:35,663 --> 01:23:37,753
Protect him.

524
01:23:42,019 --> 01:23:43,697
My valiant, my valiant.

525
01:23:45,521 --> 01:23:48,544
We'll have many jihads to have.

526
01:23:52,519 --> 01:23:54,930
We will have many jihads.

527
01:24:07,160 --> 01:24:10,568
I bear witness that there is no god
but Allah...

528
01:24:14,184 --> 01:24:18,013
...and I bear witness that Muhammad is...

529
01:24:18,839 --> 01:24:23,350
...the servant and Messenger of Allah.

530
01:24:47,691 --> 01:24:51,539
To take roots in these lands...

531
01:24:54,386 --> 01:24:57,028
...what prices had we paid, uncle?

532
01:25:22,563 --> 01:25:24,275
Konur...

533
01:25:25,977 --> 01:25:30,224
...now, no one can take us
apart from here.

534
01:25:35,019 --> 01:25:36,651
No one.

535
01:26:32,250 --> 01:26:35,108
I won't leave you alone in this fight...

536
01:26:35,340 --> 01:26:37,975
...for my brother Kongar, I'm coming.

537
01:27:46,518 --> 01:27:51,250
As Kongar said, he knows what will
happen to him if he goes with all his...

538
01:27:51,891 --> 01:27:55,467
...men, he took only one of them with
him.

539
01:27:58,629 --> 01:28:02,533
They move slowly because of the
gifts they carry to Geyhatu.

540
01:28:03,414 --> 01:28:06,780
They will stop somewhere,
before the sun fall.

541
01:28:07,572 --> 01:28:10,784
Then, their flesh will open.

542
01:28:12,008 --> 01:28:15,633
Land will spew blood.

543
01:28:29,548 --> 01:28:32,867
Valiants who passed away for homeland...

544
01:28:33,252 --> 01:28:37,860
...lost their lives and gained
a reputation.

545
01:28:38,293 --> 01:28:41,797
This reputation is called martyrdom.

546
01:28:42,091 --> 01:28:46,473
They accompany Hz. Hamza in the heaven.

547
01:28:46,880 --> 01:28:52,534
-Give your blessings to them.
-Our blessings are upon them.

548
01:28:55,638 --> 01:28:59,699
It is our warriors who made these
lands our home.

549
01:29:01,420 --> 01:29:07,187
The warriors who fought to spread
one true faith, and the law of Turks.

550
01:29:09,508 --> 01:29:13,132
Ones who forget their martyrs, forget
their laws.

551
01:29:15,419 --> 01:29:19,804
Kayı's valiants, sisters! Don't forget!

552
01:29:20,942 --> 01:29:25,708
If we are here, it is because of them.

553
01:29:28,107 --> 01:29:31,035
Allahu Ekber. Allahu Ekber.
Allahu Ekber. Allahu Ekber.

554
01:29:56,813 --> 01:30:01,110
Take Zöhre Hatun to Kuluca Hisar
walls.

555
01:30:02,284 --> 01:30:07,325
If she served them, she should listen...

556
01:30:07,853 --> 01:30:11,010
...the sounds of bells on the other world.

557
01:30:11,010 --> 01:30:13,457
May Allah pardon her deeds.

558
01:30:50,484 --> 01:30:51,674
Aygül!

559
01:30:54,152 --> 01:30:54,916
Aygül!

560
01:30:56,115 --> 01:30:57,219
Sister!

561
01:31:00,313 --> 01:31:07,723
Allah-u Akbar!
(Allah is the greatest!)

562
01:31:08,101 --> 01:31:09,666
Allah-u Akbar!
(Allah is the greatest!)

563
01:31:09,666 --> 01:31:12,079
La ilahe illallah!
(There is no deity but Allah.)

564
01:31:12,079 --> 01:31:15,259
Allah-u Akbar!
(Allah is the greatest!)

565
01:31:15,283 --> 01:31:21,393
Allah-u Akbar!
(Allah is the greatest!)

566
01:31:28,343 --> 01:31:30,683
This is good.

567
01:31:58,584 --> 01:32:01,044
Boran.

568
01:32:01,752 --> 01:32:04,672
Look sharp.

569
01:32:05,298 --> 01:32:08,246
We are going to have a guest.

570
01:32:08,246 --> 01:32:10,726
Let it be, my Bey.

571
01:32:35,338 --> 01:32:38,648
Sofia, run!

572
01:32:39,681 --> 01:32:43,206
Run as fast as you can.

573
01:32:43,206 --> 01:32:49,707
But you should know that
you are going to...

574
01:32:49,707 --> 01:32:52,507
see my face while you are dying.

575
01:32:53,667 --> 01:32:57,357
Osman strikes again.

576
01:32:58,091 --> 01:33:01,011
Protect Princess!

577
01:34:08,699 --> 01:34:12,009
My Bey, what is this?

578
01:34:12,562 --> 01:34:17,292
We take refuge in the name of Allah.
We take refuge from the accursed Satan.

579
01:34:21,184 --> 01:34:24,144
Allah-u Akbar!
(Allah is the greatest!)

580
01:34:31,100 --> 01:34:34,197
Osman thinks he has tricked us with Kongar.

581
01:34:34,197 --> 01:34:36,809
Balgay will need us.

582
01:34:36,809 --> 01:34:39,759
We are not in a hurry.

583
01:34:39,995 --> 01:34:43,765
Vuka! Come with me.

584
01:34:47,715 --> 01:34:52,735
- Sofia is running, Bamsı Bey.
- I see, Dumrul, I see.

585
01:35:02,089 --> 01:35:07,621
Let's do it, valiants!
Let's crush them!

586
01:35:07,621 --> 01:35:10,123
We shall not let Osman be alone!

587
01:35:10,123 --> 01:35:13,953
Let's do it, valiants!

588
01:36:14,453 --> 01:36:16,293
Mother...

589
01:36:18,139 --> 01:36:21,569
I wish you were here with my brother.

590
01:36:34,606 --> 01:36:37,366
Aygül is alone.

591
01:36:37,733 --> 01:36:40,293
Aygül can't be sad.

592
01:37:06,689 --> 01:37:08,929
We'll get through.

593
01:37:09,301 --> 01:37:11,611
Don't be sad.

594
01:37:31,475 --> 01:37:35,645
I will complete this, mother.

595
01:38:24,834 --> 01:38:30,064
Surround them.
Let them get stuck in here.

596
01:38:35,797 --> 01:38:40,237
Today, we take blood, Cerkutay.

597
01:38:40,663 --> 01:38:45,343
Sun shall be red.

598
01:39:18,442 --> 01:39:20,382
Alps!

599
01:39:42,114 --> 01:39:48,124
They are not humans, Bamsı Bey.
They are not!

600
01:39:50,663 --> 01:39:53,028
How are we going to deal
with them, my Bey?

601
01:39:53,028 --> 01:39:57,226
No, sons.
Do not lose hope.

602
01:39:57,226 --> 01:40:02,476
La ya'lemu'l-ğaybe illallah.
(Only Allah knows the future)

603
01:40:18,379 --> 01:40:22,729
Bang your swords in these devils' hearts!

604
01:40:23,752 --> 01:40:27,102
Allah-u Akbar!
(Allah is the greatest!)

605
01:40:43,743 --> 01:40:47,767
Gather rope and needles, my beautiful
daughter.

606
01:40:47,767 --> 01:40:50,570
We need to repair the tents.

607
01:40:50,570 --> 01:40:53,470
I did, Hazal Hatun.
I told the girls about this.

608
01:40:53,470 --> 01:40:57,163
They will tell us how many tents
we have to darn.

609
01:40:57,163 --> 01:41:00,823
Then, we are going to start working
with Hatuns.

610
01:41:08,193 --> 01:41:10,493
They married in a hurry.

611
01:41:10,544 --> 01:41:15,489
They have sacrificed a lot recently.

612
01:41:15,489 --> 01:41:17,964
They wasted the new bride.

613
01:41:17,964 --> 01:41:21,364
We'll get through this.
Don't be sad.

614
01:41:21,696 --> 01:41:27,806
Hatuns! There are too many damaged tents
in the downtown. We need to fix them.

615
01:41:28,205 --> 01:41:32,615
We can gather sedge. If we act together,
we can darn it in two days.

616
01:41:32,669 --> 01:41:36,869
You are right, my daughter.
Take Hatuns and do it.

617
01:41:37,788 --> 01:41:42,579
The doctor who came for our woundeds
is good. He'll cure them inshaallah.

618
01:41:42,579 --> 01:41:45,278
- Inshaallah.
- Inshaallah.

619
01:41:45,278 --> 01:41:47,638
Aygül?

620
01:41:48,638 --> 01:41:50,608
What is happening?

621
01:42:29,517 --> 01:42:34,727
This is a nice day to die, Osman.

622
01:42:50,517 --> 01:42:56,337
Then we can welcome you in the...

623
01:42:56,648 --> 01:43:00,298
Turk's table of death, Balgay.

624
01:43:43,419 --> 01:43:46,649
Come on, Balgay.

625
01:43:47,223 --> 01:43:49,723
Kongar.

626
01:43:52,803 --> 01:43:55,683
Kongar is dead.

627
01:43:56,375 --> 01:43:59,835
Göktuğ returned for you.

628
01:44:06,806 --> 01:44:09,346
Treason.

629
01:44:10,657 --> 01:44:15,997
You betrayed me.

630
01:44:17,552 --> 01:44:20,372
We don't hunt birds.

631
01:44:21,677 --> 01:44:24,237
We feed them.

632
01:44:34,256 --> 01:44:37,086
How can you do that to me?

633
01:44:37,140 --> 01:44:40,060
You were like a son to me!

634
01:44:40,069 --> 01:44:42,566
I took your soul!

635
01:44:42,566 --> 01:44:46,090
How can you do that to me?

636
01:44:46,090 --> 01:44:51,770
I am armed with my mother's lullaby
and shahada, elhamdulillah(thank Allah).

637
01:44:55,683 --> 01:44:58,513
You stole my soul.

638
01:44:58,583 --> 01:45:03,033
You took my mother, father, brother.

639
01:45:04,092 --> 01:45:08,272
And I will take your filthy heart today.

640
01:45:13,291 --> 01:45:17,881
Come on then.
Both of you...

641
01:45:19,980 --> 01:45:22,960
shall die.

642
01:45:26,413 --> 01:45:30,236
Allah is eternal!

643
01:46:01,900 --> 01:46:05,980
Die, son of devil, die!

644
01:46:49,224 --> 01:46:52,494
Aygül, don't, my sister.

645
01:46:52,554 --> 01:46:54,749
Give that dagger to me.

646
01:46:54,749 --> 01:46:57,819
We'll get through this, don't be sad.

647
01:47:00,595 --> 01:47:03,735
We'll get through this, don't be sad.

648
01:47:08,571 --> 01:47:10,531
Aygül!

649
01:47:11,640 --> 01:47:14,906
Aygül, daughter. Aygül.

650
01:47:14,906 --> 01:47:20,918
Go away! You accepted The Dark Sultan
in your place!

651
01:47:20,918 --> 01:47:25,208
Everybody's gone, Aygül is left alone!

652
01:47:28,350 --> 01:47:31,620
You are not alone, my daughter.
There's Bala.

653
01:47:31,983 --> 01:47:35,153
Your father is here.
Also Burçin is here.

654
01:47:35,403 --> 01:47:38,473
Don't do it.

655
01:47:43,702 --> 01:47:47,642
Everywhere is in blood.
We can't clean it!

656
01:47:47,663 --> 01:47:50,063
You did it!

657
01:47:55,122 --> 01:47:59,772
Aygül, look...

658
01:47:59,836 --> 01:48:01,406
your father...

659
01:48:03,795 --> 01:48:08,095
would be very sad, don't do it.

660
01:48:08,841 --> 01:48:12,543
I have no father, no mother, no brother.

661
01:48:12,543 --> 01:48:16,523
I don't have anyone!

662
01:48:17,900 --> 01:48:25,100
No, my daughter, no. You have a father
who would sacrifice everything for you

663
01:48:25,100 --> 01:48:26,825
Don't do it.

664
01:48:26,825 --> 01:48:29,335
Enough!

665
01:49:11,655 --> 01:49:15,665
First, you took my dignity.

666
01:49:16,853 --> 01:49:20,296
Then, my son.

667
01:49:20,296 --> 01:49:23,306
Göktuğ has found himself.

668
01:49:23,317 --> 01:49:27,437
I will burn you all, Osman.

669
01:49:27,742 --> 01:49:31,312
I will wipe you out.

670
01:50:42,930 --> 01:50:43,940
Boran.

671
01:51:08,685 --> 01:51:11,355
You'll pay for your betrayal, Kongar.

672
01:51:17,706 --> 01:51:18,636
Göktuğ...

673
01:52:13,657 --> 01:52:14,857
Göktuğ!

674
01:52:15,543 --> 01:52:16,613
Göktuğ.

675
01:52:20,135 --> 01:52:21,755
Are you okay, brother?

676
01:52:29,832 --> 01:52:33,482
I won't die before those ignobles, my Bey.

677
01:52:50,682 --> 01:52:54,022
He'll be killed...

678
01:52:54,450 --> 01:52:57,660
with our holy swords, Göktuğ!

679
01:53:00,289 --> 01:53:02,549
Now, it's time.

680
01:53:13,517 --> 01:53:15,927
I wanted to be a bride...

681
01:53:16,332 --> 01:53:18,552
and wear a wedding dress.

682
01:53:19,594 --> 01:53:23,034
I wanted to! But...

683
01:53:24,544 --> 01:53:26,964
They wanted power.

684
01:53:28,175 --> 01:53:29,955
They sacrificed me.

685
01:53:31,263 --> 01:53:32,953
They burned me!

686
01:53:35,506 --> 01:53:36,516
Aygül.

687
01:53:40,571 --> 01:53:44,571
They nearly killed me.

688
01:53:45,953 --> 01:53:48,023
They took my brother.

689
01:53:52,328 --> 01:53:56,508
Now, this Sultan took my mother!

690
01:53:57,061 --> 01:54:00,141
There's blood everywhere!

691
01:54:06,007 --> 01:54:07,757
My turn will come.

692
01:54:08,292 --> 01:54:09,762
I know.

693
01:54:11,811 --> 01:54:14,491
You can't see.

694
01:54:15,226 --> 01:54:16,946
You can't.

695
01:54:20,623 --> 01:54:22,843
I see the darkness.

696
01:54:23,800 --> 01:54:27,440
This cruel Sultan will do
whatever it takes.

697
01:54:28,968 --> 01:54:31,248
I see it.

698
01:54:34,999 --> 01:54:38,759
She deceived all of you.

699
01:54:38,759 --> 01:54:41,449
But she can't touch me!

700
01:54:41,570 --> 01:54:44,290
- Daughter.
- Move!

701
01:54:51,728 --> 01:54:53,158
My beautiful daughter.

702
01:54:53,963 --> 01:54:55,723
My beautiful child.

703
01:54:56,437 --> 01:54:58,207
I did...

704
01:54:58,757 --> 01:55:00,177
It's my fault.

705
01:55:00,811 --> 01:55:03,801
Come on. Kill me, daughter.

706
01:55:04,181 --> 01:55:07,041
Move! I said move!

707
01:55:08,495 --> 01:55:12,235
Kill me, daughter.
I'm guilty.

708
01:55:14,767 --> 01:55:18,567
Kill me if it calms you down.
Come on.

709
01:55:18,771 --> 01:55:21,291
- Come on, daughter.
- Move!

710
01:55:23,721 --> 01:55:25,561
Don't, Aygül.

711
01:55:25,983 --> 01:55:27,463
I'll be so sorry.

712
01:55:29,195 --> 01:55:31,705
I can't take care of
your baby if I'm sorry.

713
01:55:34,784 --> 01:55:36,924
I haven't fed him yet.

714
01:55:37,781 --> 01:55:40,061
Let's feed him together.

715
01:55:43,711 --> 01:55:45,431
Do you hear it?

716
01:55:45,973 --> 01:55:47,403
Your baby is crying.

717
01:55:49,340 --> 01:55:51,280
He wants you, Aygül.

718
01:55:51,392 --> 01:55:52,872
Come on.

719
01:55:56,553 --> 01:55:58,603
Come on, daughter.

720
01:56:11,839 --> 01:56:13,349
Take care of the baby.

721
01:56:14,931 --> 01:56:16,811
I'll kill this woman!

722
01:56:21,962 --> 01:56:24,572
What did you do?!

723
01:56:28,274 --> 01:56:32,814
What did you do?! What did you do?

724
01:56:35,715 --> 01:56:39,225
What did you do?

725
01:56:40,732 --> 01:56:44,522
What did you do? Everything was
going to be okay!

726
01:56:45,908 --> 01:56:48,338
What did you do?

727
01:56:48,685 --> 01:56:51,795
Everything was
going to be okay!

728
01:56:53,278 --> 01:56:56,088
What did you do?!

729
01:56:58,465 --> 01:57:01,805
Everything was going to be okay!
Everything was going to be okay!

730
01:57:03,077 --> 01:57:07,077
What did you do?!
Everything was going to be okay!

731
01:57:22,516 --> 01:57:23,606
Osman.

732
01:57:24,790 --> 01:57:26,290
My Osman.

733
01:57:27,261 --> 01:57:28,321
Osman.

734
01:57:42,727 --> 01:57:45,067
Osman.

735
01:57:48,633 --> 01:57:50,063
Ya Allah!

736
01:57:52,895 --> 01:57:54,915
Are you okay, brother?

737
01:58:26,303 --> 01:58:28,993
Hold on, valiants!

738
01:58:29,435 --> 01:58:30,515
Bamsı Bey.

739
01:58:31,182 --> 01:58:34,722
They nearly killed all of us, my Bey.

740
01:58:36,561 --> 01:58:39,151
I know, son.
I know.

741
01:58:39,641 --> 01:58:43,231
Now, go to the tent.

742
01:58:43,231 --> 01:58:46,701
Inform Gündüz Bey and Dündar Bey.

743
01:58:47,008 --> 01:58:51,248
I'll go to Osman.
I won't leave my Osman alone.

744
01:58:51,372 --> 01:58:55,362
Come on, valiants! Come on!

745
01:59:08,550 --> 01:59:10,260
Come on!

746
01:59:29,286 --> 01:59:32,476
Everything was going to be okay!
What did you do?

747
01:59:32,972 --> 01:59:36,972
What did you do?!
What did you do?

748
01:59:39,478 --> 01:59:41,358
Aygül.
Aygül.

749
01:59:41,629 --> 01:59:43,989
- Aygül!
- What did you do?!

750
01:59:44,033 --> 01:59:45,433
Don't cry.

751
01:59:48,613 --> 01:59:50,253
Don't cry.

752
01:59:51,742 --> 01:59:53,672
Don't cry, my beautiful girl.

753
01:59:57,859 --> 02:00:01,069
- Don't cry.
- Move!

754
02:00:13,934 --> 02:00:15,174
Aygül.

755
02:00:19,609 --> 02:00:23,259
I always wanted a daughter like you.

756
02:00:25,460 --> 02:00:27,130
I don't have a daughter.

757
02:00:33,042 --> 02:00:35,442
Willowy like you...

758
02:00:35,522 --> 02:00:37,582
Beautiful like you...

759
02:00:39,064 --> 02:00:40,344
Will you...

760
02:00:46,838 --> 02:00:49,588
be my daughter, Aygül?

761
02:01:18,702 --> 02:01:20,422
Can I?

762
02:01:21,455 --> 02:01:22,685
Yes.

763
02:01:25,130 --> 02:01:26,430
You can.

764
02:01:32,894 --> 02:01:35,974
I'll say that Aygül is my daughter...

765
02:01:38,330 --> 02:01:40,000
...that she is my child.

766
02:01:48,227 --> 02:01:49,427
Aygül...

767
02:01:58,482 --> 02:02:00,682
All the world hear that...

768
02:02:02,511 --> 02:02:04,541
Aygül is my daughter.

769
02:02:06,261 --> 02:02:08,901
And I'm her mother, I'll say!

770
02:02:34,031 --> 02:02:36,201
Okay?

771
02:02:58,063 --> 02:02:59,273
Aygül!

772
02:03:00,152 --> 02:03:01,402
Daughter!

773
02:03:02,844 --> 02:03:03,954
Aygül!

774
02:03:09,789 --> 02:03:12,199
Osman Bey.
Let me do it.

775
02:03:13,130 --> 02:03:17,130
I want to take revenge on my mother
and father.

776
02:03:51,662 --> 02:03:56,712
I loved you like my child.

777
02:03:58,844 --> 02:04:03,024
And you'll kill me as if I'm a dog.

778
02:04:05,440 --> 02:04:10,710
Your love is like your courage.
It's a lie!

779
02:04:12,611 --> 02:04:14,431
Die, dog!

780
02:04:30,352 --> 02:04:31,632
Göktuğ.

781
02:04:32,068 --> 02:04:32,838
Göktuğ!

782
02:04:32,941 --> 02:04:34,061
Osman!

783
02:04:36,963 --> 02:04:38,913
Just in time, Sofia.

784
02:05:08,314 --> 02:05:11,354
Yoı betrayed Geyhatu
and then my father...

785
02:05:11,530 --> 02:05:14,990
and then me and Osman, Balgay.

786
02:05:22,123 --> 02:05:24,723
You don't deserve to live.

787
02:05:26,827 --> 02:05:29,447
Right, Osman Bey?

788
02:05:31,481 --> 02:05:33,181
If someone rebels...

789
02:05:34,750 --> 02:05:36,930
that someone dies.

790
02:05:41,634 --> 02:05:43,334
Perfidious!

791
02:06:17,892 --> 02:06:19,052
Nice.

792
02:06:21,692 --> 02:06:24,172
You saved me from trouble.

793
02:06:24,720 --> 02:06:25,780
Osman...

794
02:06:26,719 --> 02:06:30,329
Like Bamsı and his Alps on my way.

795
02:06:34,257 --> 02:06:36,457
They are dead.

796
02:06:42,224 --> 02:06:44,004
You should give in!

797
02:06:46,220 --> 02:06:50,220
Don't you still
know that Turks don't give in?

798
02:06:52,527 --> 02:06:56,057
I'll see you when you're out of breath.

799
02:07:10,560 --> 02:07:13,860
If someone who's out of breath dies...

800
02:07:14,489 --> 02:07:17,769
for the Allah's sake...

801
02:07:18,499 --> 02:07:21,039
Allah-u Akbar! (Allah is the greatest!)

802
02:07:21,039 --> 02:07:39,809
Please contact turkision@gmail.com
for any inquiries